          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "King's Field: Pilot Style",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The three King's Field PS1 games form a trilogy relating the saga of a mythical country named Verdite. King's Field 1 (released only in Japan) was the first RPG for the Playstation console and King's Field 2 (released as \"King's Field\" in the US and EU) was the first ever Playstation RPG in the US and Europe.\n\nKing's Field: Pilot Style is a mini game whose story takes place in the period between King's Field 2 and King's Field 3. Pilot Style was given away as a promotional item at a game show in Japan and went relatively unnoticed. It only takes about an hour to complete, but it is an interesting tidbit in the King's Field world.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La trilogía de King's Field para PS1 narra la saga de un país mítico llamado Verdite. King's Field 1 (lanzado solo en Japón) fue el primer RPG para la consola PlayStation, y King's Field 2 (lanzado como «King's Field» en EE. UU. y la UE) fue el primer RPG de PlayStation en Estados Unidos y Europa.\n\nKing's Field: Pilot Style es un minijuego cuya historia transcurre entre King's Field 2 y King's Field 3. Se regaló como artículo promocional en una feria de videojuegos en Japón y pasó bastante desapercibido. Se completa en aproximadamente una hora, pero es una curiosidad interesante dentro del universo de King's Field.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1996",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
